	)
	(text "Atlas ORP OEM (U2): SMBus/I2C only, 10-100 kHz, default address 0x66 (device type reg 0x00 = 2). VCC 3.0-5.5 V, 3.5 mA (LED on), from VDD_ISO.\nPull-ups R3/R4 4.7k are on the Isolation sheet: do not add more. INT (pin 7) goes to the J5 test pad only (firmware polls reg 0x07).\nNC pins 2, 9, 10 must stay floating (datasheet). Pin 5 PRB GND is the source of the analog ground AGND_ISO.\nPCB: J1 within a few mm of U2, ORP_PRB 0.4 mm wide and as short as possible, AGND_ISO guard pour round it on all layers,\nno vias under the OEM. AGND_ISO joins GND_ISO only at R5. Wash all flux off after soldering (datasheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "34163b03-53ad-4b4e-a765-240039e94898")
	)
